Consumption of alcohol on city streets and sidewalks are allowed; limited to the entertainment district as set depicted below:
There is hereby established an "entertainment district" within the city wherein open containers of alcoholic beverages shall be permitted.
The entertainment district shall consist of the area contained in the red portion of the map set forth herein above and as illustrated on the "entertainment district map," including the sidewalks, rights-of-way and buildings therein.
{.}
{.}
{.}
